# API Inventory — account.ui.com / sso.ui.com

Base hosts: `https://sso.ui.com` (SSO), `https://account.svc.ui.com` (account BE), `https://geo.svc.ui.com`.

## SSO endpoints (from JS config)
| Method | Path | Auth | Notes |
|--------|------|------|-------|
